---
component: lampsOut
params:
  where: string
  memory: string
  depth: { enum: [brief, long] }
---

## Lamps out

::sfx{sound="train whistle, long"}
::vfx{type="blackOut"}
<match on="@depth">
  <when is="brief">
    @narrator{code="0010"}: The lamps gutter, and for a moment {{@where}} is only noise.
  </when>
  <when is="long">
    @narrator{code="0020"}: Every lamp in {{@where}} shrinks to a blue bead and then to nothing, and the dark smells of soot and wet stone.
    @narrator{code="0030"}: Four minutes. Anyone can walk anywhere in four minutes.
  </when>
</match>
@inspector{code="0010" mono}: {{@memory}}
